Explanation:

Top-of-atmosphere balance yields $sigma T_a^4 = sigma T_e^4$. Surface balance gives $(1-alpha)S_0/4 + sigma T_a^4 = sigma T_s^4 ==> 2 sigma T_e^4 = sigma T_s^4 ==> T_s = 2^(1/4) T_e approx 303 "K"$.
